    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d653">

                <pb facs="0685" n="587" xml:id="pg587"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.9431/38: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Castle</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extracts]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-18T11:00:00+09:00">March 18, 1930—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 18—8:17 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>47. My No. 43, March 12, 4 p.m.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d653-f1"/> The Foreign
                    Office has furnished me with an outline of the agreement …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Add following paragraph: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“No. 6. Notification by the National Government of its intention to call
                            a conference of the representatives of creditors on or before October 1,
                            1930, for effectuating the consolidation of the unsecured and
                            inadequately secured obligations of China.”<anchor n="23"
                                xml:id="d653-f2"/></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d653-f1" n="22" xml:id="d653-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it contained Japanese press reports on five provisions of the
                    agreement between the Republic of China and the Empire of Japan regulating
                    customs relations between the two countries, initiated March 11, 1930. For text
                    of the agreement signed at Nanking, May 6, 1930, see League of Nations Treaty
                    Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">cvi</hi>, p. 295.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d653-f2" n="23" xml:id="d653-f2-content">
                <p>For exchange of notes on this subject, see <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p.
                    318.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
